# This repo is developed from Windows against a Linux venv in WSL and ships in a
# Linux container. Without this, a file written by a Windows-side tool comes back
# CRLF and shows up as a whole-file diff with no content change — which is how
# frontend/src/fixtures/teacher_knowledge_package.json once turned into a
# 722-line diff that changed nothing.
#
# scripts/generate_schema.py cannot catch this on its own: it compares with
# read_text(), which translates CRLF to LF on read, so a CRLF-on-disk generated
# artifact reads back as identical and is never reported as drift.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
